<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a process operator to a flow leaving it."@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemBorder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The boundary determining the observation horizon of a process. Under certain conditions it may also be regarded as a balance limit for incoming and outgoing products and energies."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Felix Gehlhoff" .
_:N92fbbb8dc5b0417998e80016bf5ede6e <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ProcessOperator> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Flow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A directed connection of products between process operators."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindet einen Prozessoperator mit einem aus ihm ausgehenden Fluss."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A network describing a technical process. Its nodes are the states of products, energies and information, its directed edges are the transformation steps carried out by process operators."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#consistsOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "consists of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Normative basis: VDI/VDE 3682 Part 1 and Part 2, issue May 2015.\r\n\r\nTwelve classes and seven relations. Every definition carries the German wording of the standard alongside its English translation, since the standard is issued bilingually.\r\n\r\nScope: Part 1 in full, and from Part 2 the state as a class of the information model. The attribute structure of Part 2 Section 4.4 is not covered."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#ParallelFlow> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Parallel Flow"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:Nfd5af182bc9840f6bf483a74fa73c5d9 .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Alexander Fay" .
_:N2efc61e26d474622b6ccd64a90bcd048 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#members> _:N86ce52316dcf4b06852912bd2025ba68 .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Marvin Schieseck" .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindet einen Fluss mit dem Zustand, den er trägt."@de .
_:N2c1de5efaf2a4d029f904e1893d60c17 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Information> .
