<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#isAssignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "One relation used along a chain of two steps, from the operator to the assignment and from the assignment to the resource. Its domain and range are therefore unions, since each covers both ends of the chain."@en .
